# Egypt Payment Guardian Cursor Rule

Load `skills/egypt-payment-guardian/SKILL.md` before implementing or reviewing Egypt payment code. Use provider references under `skills/egypt-payment-guardian/references/providers/` only when that provider is relevant.

Payment non-negotiables:

- Never trust redirect alone.
- Verify signature, HMAC, or SecureHash before processing.
- Keep payment secrets server-side.
- Compare amount, currency, order reference, and provider reference.
- Process callbacks and retries idempotently.

If official provider docs are partial or gated, ask for merchant docs. Do not invent endpoints, fields, signatures, status names, test cards, or credentials.
